 Approvals
 With auto, the agents work and merge on their own under the rules. Change that
 any time in /permissions and /approvals.

 ❯ 1. Auto (recommended)    Rules and a reviewer from another provider decide,
                            and you're asked when a rule fails.
   2. Supervised            You approve the goal, the plan, and every merge.
   3. Auto preview          You approve, and Argonauts Code learns what it would
                            have decided.

